          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Invariants\n\nContent preserves its material value; choosing a View does not rewrite it. Graph identity remains on the Declaration. Legacy readers are compatibility behavior, not the format new authors should prefer."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-content",
          "nodeId": "content-invariants"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-contract",
      "label": "Contract",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": -1000,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Contract\n\nWrite `data.content = { kind, value }`. The current reader accepts markdown, html, svg, canvas, text, json and image. Image values may be a source string or an object with src/alt/fit; canvas uses an object payload. JSON values are stringified for preview. Unknown kinds fall back to text. Older direct fields and renderShape are read for compatibility; new authoring uses content.kind/value."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-content",
          "nodeId": "content-contract"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-ports",
      "label": "Ports and Relationships",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Ports and Relationships\n\nA View delegates through an outgoing `surface-delegate` relationship to Content. The reader also accepts `view.content`/`content` role aliases and legacy `data.sourceNodeId`. The first matching relationship selects the delegated material. Content does not own the Surface chain."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-content",
          "nodeId": "content-ports"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-behavior",
      "label": "Behavior",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": -1000,
        "y": 1040
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
